{%- doc -%}
  SixthGear Studios: outputs "true" when the variant picker hides the product's Paper choice: the
  block's "Hide the paper choice" setting is on and the product has a Paper option with more than
  one value (an option with one value is already hidden by "Hide options with only one choice").

  @param {product} product_resource - The product
  @param {boolean} [hide_paper] - The variant picker block's sgs_hide_paper setting

  @example
  {%- capture paper_hidden -%}{% render 'sgs-paper-hidden', product_resource: product_resource, hide_paper: block.settings.sgs_hide_paper %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  if hide_paper
    for probe_option in product_resource.options_with_values
      assign probe_lower = probe_option.name | downcase
      if probe_lower contains 'paper' and probe_option.values.size > 1
        echo 'true'
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}
